{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55968","headline":"赠廖融 · 王正己","name":"赠廖融","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湖南虽不就卑官，高卧深云道自安。\n病起坐当秋阁迥，酒醒吟对夜涛寒。\n炉中药熟分僧服，榻上琴闲借我弹。\n幸遇清朝有良鉴，退身争忍似方干。\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王正己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55968.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55968","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}